Cell["\<\
Get coefficient functions from the ancillary file using FORM . They come as \
substitution list. Note that this file needed to be slightly modified to \
become readable by FORM, see README file.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.933299339723057*^9, 3.933299408260778*^9}, {
